 "remarks": "A rarely offered opportunity to live in this vibrant beachside community. 3 Bedroom, 2 bath home, with an open kitchen, dining, living floor plan totaling 1600 square feet. Additional loft off of the family room is the perfect space for home office, playroom or extra bedroom. An additional 3 parking spaces in the driveway. Landlord taking care of lawn and exterior plant care. Fully fenced in back yard with stone patio enhances outdoor living in the Bay! Landlord has also paid Noroton Bay Association dues so you can take full advantage of the beach and all the wonderful neighborhood association parties and activities. Lease length flexible",
